# K03 NS-ROLES-2 REQUIRED POSITIVE, red until its dependency is built (Codex K03-NS2-COVERAGE-20261007-21;
# steps/defects.md#reference-field-consumers).
# `box: Model` in a method's own named Structure Local binds box to Model: a write through Local\box reaches Model.
# Today: "a reference binding in a method's named Structure is not built yet" (the limit row
# unit_ns2_local_limit_refused).  Exit 7; 81 if the write did not reach Model.
Model:
    int: v 1
end: Model
fn: m () int
    Local:
        box: Model
    end: Local
    Local\box\v: 5
    if: Model\v != 5
        return: 81
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
